  spices:
  - spiceName: Pepper
    costText: 'Cost Price: 12 Varahas / Veesai'
    narration: Pepper costs you 12 Varahas per Veesai. It is among the most sought-after
      goods in the market, making it one of your most profitable spices when sold
      wisely.
    narrationClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c0af79e51af17ab48ab51eb8b8505d0e, type: 3}
    uiAnchor: {fileID: 386362050}
  - spiceName: Turmeric
    costText: 'Cost Price: 5 Varahas / Veesai'
    narration: Turmeric costs 5 Varahas per Veesai. Though inexpensive, it remains
      a staple spice valued for its colour, flavour, and medicinal use.
    narrationClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3fa7a35433fd9eb4f9400df39fbe8ae5, type: 3}
    uiAnchor: {fileID: 1474245902}
  - spiceName: Cardamom
    costText: 'Cost Price: 18 Varahas / Veesai'
    narration: Cardamom costs 18 Varahas per Veesai. Rare and fragrant, it is highly
      prized in royal kitchens and temple offerings.
    narrationClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a9d8ffad4a148444698c2e5a80bac95e, type: 3}
    uiAnchor: {fileID: 480705086}
  - spiceName: Cinnamon
    costText: 'Cost Price: 20 Varahas / Veesai'
    narration: Cinnamon costs 20 Varahas per Veesai. Brought through long trade routes,
      it is one of the most valuable spices in the Hampi Bazaar.
    narrationClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 34ca75209cecff44aa2e3d2cf89649f5, type: 3}
    uiAnchor: {fileID: 623430303}
  finalPromptDuration: 4
  finalPromptText: A Spice Cost Guide has been added to your tools. You can open
    it during trade by pressing X.
  globalVolume: {fileID: 1320008368}
